Stats and info retrieved from BGG API calls:
Basic Game Information
id - BGG game ID (integer)
name - Primary game name (string)
alternateNames - Array of alternate names with types (e.g., alternate, expansion)
yearPublished - Year the game was published (integer)
description - Game description (HTML stripped, plain text)
thumbnail - URL to thumbnail image
image - URL to full-size image
Player & Time Information
minPlayers - Minimum number of players (integer)
maxPlayers - Maximum number of players (integer)
bestPlayerCount - Best player count from community polls (string, e.g., "4")
playingTime - Average playing time in minutes (integer)
minPlayTime - Minimum playing time in minutes (integer)
maxPlayTime - Maximum playing time in minutes (integer)
minAge - Minimum recommended age (integer)
Ratings & Statistics
average - Average rating (float, typically 1-10)
bayesAverage - Bayesian average rating (float)
usersRated - Number of users who rated the game (integer)
rank - Overall BGG board game rank (integer)
complexity - Game complexity/weight rating (float, typically 1-5)
ownedCount - Number of users who own the game (integer)
Category Ranks
strategyGamesRank - Rank in Strategy Games category (string)
familyGamesRank - Rank in Family Games category (string)
partyGamesRank - Rank in Party Games category (string)
abstractsRank - Rank in Abstract Games category (string)
thematicRank - Rank in Thematic Games category (string)
wargamesRank - Rank in War Games category (string)
childrensGamesRank - Rank in Children's Games category (string)
cgsRank - Rank in CCG/Customizable Games category (string)
Game Attributes (Arrays)
mechanics - Array of game mechanics (e.g., "Dice Rolling", "Worker Placement")
categories - Array of game categories/themes (e.g., "Economic", "Fantasy")
designers - Array of designer names
publishers - Array of publisher names
artists - Array of artist names
Community Polls
languageDependence - Language dependence level from polls (string, e.g., "No necessary in-game text")
suggestedPlayerAge - Suggested player age from polls (string)
Physical Properties
weight - Physical weight of the game (float, in pounds/kilograms)
dimensions - Physical dimensions (currently not extracted, returns null)
Note: The API calls use stats=1 parameter to include rating statistics. Search results return only id, name, and yearPublished; full details are fetched via fetchBGGGameDetails() or fetchBGGGameDetailsBatch() for multiple games.





